[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_KEY_OF_UNFETTERED_ENTRANCE]
Key of Unfettered Entrance

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_KEY_OF_UNFETTERED_ENTRANCE_DESC]
It can open any lock in the world... but only once, then the key will break.
So please remember, don’t lock the door when you steal something, otherwise it will be a bit embarrassing.
Of course you can try to bring two, if there is something in this world worth spending two keys of unfettered entrance to steal. Or simpler —
DON’T LOCK THE DOOR!  DON’T LOCK THE DOOR!  DON’T LOCK THE DOOR!  DON’T LOCK THE DOOR YOU F***ING IDIOT!!!

